OL,3,GNEWSAPolice adopting protocol to find
OL,4,Amissing veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn initiative designed to help police
OL,7,Frespond more effectively when a serving
OL,8,Fmember of the armed forces, military
OL,9,Fveteran or reservist is reported
OL,10,Fmissing has been rolled out in Devon
OL,11,Fand Cornwall.
OL,13,FDevon and Cornwall Police have adopted
OL,14,Fthe Forcer Protocol, which allows
OL,15,Ffamily and friends to pre-submit
OL,16,Finformation before someone reaches a
OL,17,Fcrisis point and goes missing.
OL,19,FThe protocol is named in honour of
OL,20,Fsolider Alan Forcer, who took his own
OL,21,Flife after going missing in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
