OL,3,GNEWSAPolice adopting protocol to find
OL,4,Amissing veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said information submitted
OL,7,Fwas completely confidential and
OL,8,Fofficers could only access it when
OL,9,Fsomeone was reported missing, adding:
OL,10,F"Once located, they can be signposted
OL,11,Fto the appropriate support services."
